### Test API Backend - PhongTro Modern
### Cài VSCode extension: REST Client hoặc Thunder Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = your_token_here

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "role": "user"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### 4. Get Posts (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&limit=10&city=Hà Nội
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=phòng trọ&minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=5000000
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Post Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/68d611489f3c9c01ecd12caa
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get User Profile (Auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/overview
Accept: application/json

### 9. Create Post (Auth required - Landlord)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Phòng trọ test",
  "price": 3000000,
  "area": 25,
  "address": "Test address",
  "city": "Hà Nội"
}

### 10. Update Post (Auth required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/post_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Phòng trọ updated"
}

### 11. Delete Post (Auth required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/post_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Saved Properties (Auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-properties/dashboard/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Save Property (Auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-properties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "68d611489f3c9c01ecd12caa"
}
